  "aboutSagana": "About SAGANA",
  "aboutSaganaBody": "SAGANA helps buyers connect with trusted SP3 farmers and manage purchases in one place.",
  "adminAboutSaganaBody": "SAGANA helps cooperative Managers manage members, marketplace listings, loans, inventory, and reports in one place.",
  "farmerAboutSaganaBody": "SAGANA helps you record harvests, list produce, track loans and expenses, and manage your cooperative contributions in one place.",
  "aboutSaganaFullDescription": "SAGANA (Streamlined Agricultural Gateway for Agribusiness, Networking, and Analytics) was built as a capstone project for the SP3 Agriculture Cooperative in Barangay Payanas, Torrijos, Marinduque. It replaces what was previously tracked by hand in a paper logbook, bringing cooperative membership, harvests, marketplace listings, loans, prices, and reports into one system — built to keep working offline, since the barangay has no reliable mobile signal, and to sync automatically once a connection is available.",
